{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1608076800, "end_date": 1608767999, "month_true_total": 210, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:54:54 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "82984375", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037966931", "personaname": "ViktorL", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198037966931/", "num_games_owned": 355, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 22015, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15409, "last_played": 1655244517, "avatar": "de99cade0afe15a81d9e769b9a309c7502609c6e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "继续更新啊~真好玩~", "timestamp_created": 1608751274, "timestamp_updated": 1608751274, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82948370", "author": {"steamid": "76561198177104857", "personaname": "Src641", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198177104857/", "num_games_owned": 111, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 842, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 44, "last_played": 1677873875, "avatar": "9d4bfd0053497656441a5cf37f8dd571edff3da8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "买完第二天遇见冬季特惠打折，emmmmmmmm。是真的气人", "timestamp_created": 1608722771, "timestamp_updated": 1608729960, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82946040", "author": {"steamid": "76561198415892385", "personaname": "Cheshire", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198415892385/", "num_games_owned": 125, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 56222, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9750, "last_played": 1776952045, "avatar": "818239740e355c6ae426dfabd9f7fb30fa773713"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "快，给俺来几个朋友一起爆浆大虫子", "timestamp_created": 1608719988, "timestamp_updated": 1608719988, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.511834323406219482", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82944674", "author": {"steamid": "76561198850027135", "personaname": "这这这能把我鲨了啊啊啊啊啊啊啊？！！", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198850027135/", "num_games_owned": 192, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 47774, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25820, "last_played": 1781880984, "avatar": "5a44197f655f8767c7df72d71a07a5e5017e5ea8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "一开始我玩钻机，队伍节奏核心角色，放火烧山，掏空洞穴，挖出隧道与队友一起防守，撤退时直接直线抵达空降仓，思考如何打洞才能带领队友走向胜利，那时候我觉得这是整个游戏最好玩的角色。\n后来用工程，两个炮台提供的安全感以及榴弹炸怪的打击感（还有跳舞雷的骚气）让我感觉这才是刷怪的乐趣。\n再后来用侦察兵到处飞，什么怪物都追不上我，那时候我觉得这才是玩游戏，之前都是被游戏玩。\n再后来发现枪手才是神，无敌压制力，来多少杀多少，大怪小怪一起杀，异虫苍蝇都得死，再不济一个护盾就能扭转局势，乱杀银河。\n一开始以为晋升就算玩的久了，结果每周任务，各种词条任务，晋升到高级矿工后向萌新炫耀（虽然也可以直接改），每周深潜，各种东西层出不穷，还可以研究套路。最主要的，每个角色分工不同，定位不同，一个角色玩腻了，玩另一个角色马上又会打开新世界。\n总之就是无论如何也玩不腻。", "timestamp_created": 1608718303, "timestamp_updated": 1608718303, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.534238576889038086", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "82935408", "author": {"steamid": "76561198859297473", "personaname": "SGT N. Sansio [Bot]", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198859297473/", "num_games_owned": 101, "num_reviews": 57, "playtime_forever": 2735, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 81, "last_played": 1709194282, "avatar": "c44716ca9e6300b12225c5c3ed9f9edf2df76a01"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好游戏。但我没有朋友，还被虫子吓了一路。补充：没有朋友开黑没关系，低等级的时候野队好像也很快乐和顺利，经常迷路有点尴尬", "timestamp_created": 1608705664, "timestamp_updated": 1608833086, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.609647452831268311", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}]}